WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:06.240
Autumn of the 26th year of Longwu you ordered the eldest son Sikong Sheng to oversee the state.

00:06.320 --> 00:11.400
Then personally led 60,000 troops with Grand General Zhu Yuanzhi as commander.

00:12.040 --> 00:16.120
Zu Yue as left general Sikong Xu as right general.

00:16.440 --> 00:19.040
Marched north to face Shilang.

00:28.280 --> 00:31.400
To war.

00:32.800 --> 00:35.080
Long live Your Majesty.

00:36.680 --> 00:39.080
Long live Your Majesty.

00:40.520 --> 00:44.920
Around Beiyu Pass Xuan and Wei engaged in a life-and-death struggle.

00:45.440 --> 00:50.320
The battle line stretched for thousands of miles from Qing Province to the Eastern Sea north to Yiyang City.

00:50.440 --> 00:52.107
West to the Luo River.

00:52.440 --> 00:57.107
The sound of weapons and horses could be heard everywhere across the Central Plains.

